38,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,Projects for comfort slip a year. Those for inspection are on time. Reviews are low for single-wing benefits.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Mechanical costs rose by a fifth. No reserve was opened for the old audiovisual kit.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
