48,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,The data suggests we should choose a project with broad appeal and clear necessity.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The budget for mechanical work is inflated. We need to be careful.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
